			message: '#^Method Profotograaf\\Connection\:\:status\(\) should return array\{state\: string, connected_at\: int, last_error\: string, scope_revision\: int, embed_denied\: bool\} but returns array\{state\: ''connected''\|''disconnected''\|''revoked'', connected_at\: int, last_error\: string\}\.$#'
